WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.520
Every test passed.

2
00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:02.480
Would you ship it?

3
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.120
CrossExam challenges the tests behind that confidence.

4
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.200
This generated patch passes all four tests.

5
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.400
2 requests expose a real contract violation.

6
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:15.680
Muse Spark is our primary code-generation integration.

7
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.320
Gemini writes independent tests.

8
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.040
Subquadratic prioritizes risks.

9
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:24.880
This run uses ASI One while Muse awaits credits.

10
00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:29.600
Gemini raises validation detection from 1 to 23 out of 30.

11
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.600
Only measured improvements are promoted.

12
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:32.960
Freeze the suite.

13
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:37.440
The separate audit catches 24 of 30 faulty implementations.

14
00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.120
All 4 correct implementations pass.

15
00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:42.440
This is a public synthetic benchmark.

16
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.600
Fetch agents load the frozen suite from MongoDB.

17
00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:47.320
Broken patch blocked.

18
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:48.720
Correct code accepted.

19
00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:51.440
Both verdicts cryptographically signed.

20
00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:52.480
CrossExam.

21
00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:55.280
Make passing tests earn your trust.
